,{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12014","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21711","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"32998","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"67043","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"309530","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"108","synopsis":"Frate's betrayal has left Nero on the run with the Vanetti family in pursuit. To save the badly injured Tigre, Nero seeks the aid of Fango, who is currently holed up on the Island. In exchange for his help, Nero agrees to bring Don Orco to Fango alive. To that end, Avilio and Nero head for Orco's base of operations, Ottimo Orco.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7oB7PhRdoZ1rgJvNyMrd4pJzOEq.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"Frate's betrayal has left Nero on the run with the Vanetti family in pursuit. To save the badly injured Tigre, Nero seeks the aid of Fango, who is currently holed up on the Island. In exchange for his help, Nero agrees to bring Don Orco to Fango alive. To that end, Avilio and Nero head for Orco's base of operations, Ottimo Orco.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7oB7PhRdoZ1rgJvNyMrd4pJzOEq.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12014","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21711","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"32998","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"67043","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"309530","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"109","synopsis":"The Fango family has taken the place of the Orco family. Fango is grateful to Nero and Avilio for their hard work, and asks them to continue to work with him. But Nero is worried that Fango is going to use him and then kill him. It's then that Frate declares war on his brother, and things get to where there's no turning back. Nevertheless, Fio asks Ronaldo to make peace with Nero.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bhJ0gMASwMVLp2P1t2wf7u3OfU2.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"The Fango family has taken the place of the Orco family. Fango is grateful to Nero and Avilio for their hard work, and asks them to continue to work with him. But Nero is worried that Fango is going to use him and then kill him. It's then that Frate declares war on his brother, and things get to where there's no turning back. Nevertheless, Fio asks Ronaldo to make peace with Nero.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bhJ0gMASwMVLp2P1t2wf7u3OfU2.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"12014","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21711","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"32998","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"67043","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"309530","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"110","synopsis":"A hard-nosed prohibition agent, Delphy, is installed in Lawless. He claims he will cut out the mafia's power in the city, and begins clamping down on bars that sell bootleg liquor. Naturally, the Vanetti family considers him an unwelcome presence. While keeping one eye on Fango, Nero comes down hard against Defphy, and Avilio stands with him. But another man watches them with complicated feelings about the situation.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/c7TxgY4r9OXGqRxyDD3YWwqcQip.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 8","synopsis":"A hard-nosed pro